ror has been bid away","sev":"red","cat":"valuation","magnitude":4.420823061727727},{"text":"Operating margins 33% below sector median \u2014 a cost disadvantage the moat cannot hide","sev":"amber","cat":"moat"},{"text":"Fragmented industry with below-average profit capture \u2014 no moat to protect margins","sev":"amber","cat":"moat"},{"text":"Altman Z in the grey zone \u2014 financial health warrants monitoring","sev":"amber","cat":"quality"},{"text":"Above-average short interest at 7.9% of float","sev":"amber","cat":"sentiment"},{"text":"Insiders are net sellers (100% sell ratio, net $22.4M) \u2014 the people closest to the business are reducing their personal stake","sev":"amber","cat":"insider"},{"text":"Technology sector lagging the market significantly, underperforming by 8% over 3 months","sev":"amber","cat":"sector"},{"text":"Technology ETF trading well below its long-term trend","sev":"amber","cat":"sector"},{"text":"Elevated sector volatility (43% annualized) adds uncertainty","sev":"amber","cat":"sector"},{"text":"Cybersecurity liability and talent cost inflation \u2014 a single breach can erase years of goodwill, and the war for engineering talent compresses margins even at scale.","sev":"amber","cat":"thesis_risk"}],"sector_tailwinds":["Valued at a 668% discount to sector median EV/EBITDA","Founder-led \u2014 owner alignment that often matters more than any incentive plan","Growing faster than most Technology peers \u2014 taking share inside the profit pool"],"news_headlines":[{"title":"Rubrik (NYSE:RBRK) Price Target Raised to $150.00","source":"thelincolnianonline.com","link":"https://www.thelincolnianonline.com/2026/11/20/rubrik-nyserbrk-price-target-raised-to-150-00.html","date":"2026-11-20","timestamp":1795158404.0,"origin":"tiingo","sentiment":0.66,"tier":0,"scope":"company","tags":["analyst_action"]},{"title":"Is Rubrik (RBRK) Fully Valued After Its New Cloud Security Product Push?","source":"simplywall.st","link":"https://simplywall.st/stocks/u